- Simple, relaxing maze-solving gameplay.
- Swipe-controlled movement of a glowing player/light through a maze.
- Multiple maze shapes, including square, circular, triangular and hexagonal.
- Special-shaped mazes, such as animals and objects.
- A progression system based around constellations and unlocking new levels.
- Different gameplay modes, including timed challenges, restricted moves, collectibles and teleportation portals.
- Visually attractive colours, animations and relaxing background music.

The original game advertises thousands of mazes and more than 100 combinations of maze types, sizes and modes.&#x20;

