# MASTER APP BUILD PROMPT

## Maze – Puzzle & Relaxing Labyrinth Adventure

### 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Design and develop a complete, polished maze puzzle game inspired by the gameplay mechanics and progression systems of Maze: Puzzle and Relaxing Game by Infinity Games.

The application should recreate the appeal of classic maze puzzles while providing a large collection of progressively challenging labyrinths, different maze geometries, special maze designs, additional game modes and a relaxing visual experience.

The game should be easy to understand, enjoyable for casual players and increasingly challenging as players progress.

**Core objectives:**

- Deliver an enjoyable, relaxing maze-solving experience.
- Provide thousands of playable maze puzzles.
- Include multiple maze shapes, sizes and difficulty levels.
- Introduce a constellation-based level progression system.
- Provide several alternative gameplay modes.
- Include Firebase user authentication.
- Store puzzles, user progress and leaderboard information in Firebase.
- Allow players to compete through global and weekly leaderboards.
- Provide an administrator interface for managing puzzles and game content.

Create an original game identity, original artwork, original maze designs and original interface assets. Reproduce the gameplay principles rather than copying copyrighted assets, branding or proprietary level content.

