# 6. CONSTELLATION PROGRESSION SYSTEM

Create an attractive constellation-based progression map.

This should be one of the main features of the game.

Players progress through a collection of themed constellations by completing individual maze puzzles.

### Constellation structure

Each constellation contains multiple stars.

Each star represents an individual maze level.

Suggested structure:

- 10 constellations in the initial release.
- 20 levels per constellation.
- 200 initial levels.
- Expandable to thousands of levels.

The administrator must be able to add further constellations and levels without modifying the application code.

### Progression mechanics

- Players begin with the first constellation unlocked.
- Completing a level activates its corresponding star.
- Completing required stars unlocks subsequent levels.
- Completing all stars unlocks the next constellation.
- Display the percentage completed.
- Display locked and unlocked constellations.
- Save individual level progress.

### Constellation completion animation

When a constellation is completed:

- Animate the collected stars.
- Connect the stars with glowing lines.
- Reveal the completed constellation illustration.
- Display a completion message.
- Award a constellation completion bonus.
- Unlock the next constellation.

